{"id":"630522","name":"煎饼花卷","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/630522/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"煎饼","amount":"一包"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"温水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"3g"}],"sub":[{"name":"干面粉","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"煎饼弄碎。","img":"images/630522/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放温水泡软。","img":"images/630522/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放酵母拌匀。","img":"images/630522/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放面粉。","img":"images/630522/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"揉成面团。","img":"images/630522/step_5.jpeg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放温暖处发酵好。","img":"images/630522/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取出来，放干面粉，揉光排气。","img":"images/630522/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成饼。","img":"images/630522/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"葱叶洗净切末。","img":"images/630522/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/630522/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放熟油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/630522/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"均匀铺在面饼上。","img":"images/630522/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"卷起来，切段。","img":"images/630522/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"做花卷。","img":"images/630522/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放蒸笼里二次发酵。","img":"images/630522/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"二次发酵好，大火烧开，中火蒸25分钟，焖5分钟。","img":"images/630522/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"真好的花卷。","img":"images/630522/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/630522/step_18.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}